{"id":"7c30aa474cfc420f","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-regular-arbitrary-quotient.md","title":"正则语言对任意语言取商仍正则","display":"thm-regular-arbitrary-quotient — 正则语言对任意语言取商仍正则","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-regular-arbitrary-quotient","aliases":["73-thm-regular-arbitrary-quotient"],"display":"thm-regular-arbitrary-quotient — 正则语言对任意语言取商仍正则","depends_on":["[[73-df-language-quotients]]","[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§4.2, print pp. 133–149; PDF pp. 155–171; local closure formulation or corollary","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 3.6 and its non-effectivity warning, pp. 62–63; scans 70–71","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":4},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-regular-arbitrary-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-regular-arbitrary-quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regular-arbitrary-quotient — 正则语言对任意语言取商仍正则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"277b77eecf2ab276\" href=\"?note=277b77eecf2ab276\" title=\"73-df-language-quotients\">73-df-language-quotients</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§4.2, print pp. 133–149; PDF pp. 155–171; local closure formulation or corollary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 3.6 and its non-effectivity warning, pp. 62–63; scans 70–71"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。商见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"277b77eecf2ab276\" href=\"?note=277b77eecf2ab276\" title=\"73-df-language-quotients\">73-df-language-quotients</a>；固定识别 A 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}arbitrary\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\nF_B\\coloneqq\\{q\\in Q:\\exists y\\in B\\;\\widehat\\delta_M(q,y)\\in F\\},\\qquad I_B\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat\\delta_M(q_0,y):y\\in B\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}arbitrary\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\nF_B\\coloneqq\\{q\\in Q:\\exists y\\in B\\;\\widehat\\delta_M(q,y)\\in F\\},\\qquad I_B\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat\\delta_M(q_0,y):y\\in B\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}arbitrary\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\nA/B=L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F_B))\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}arbitrary\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\nA/B=L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F_B))\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}arbitrary\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\nB\\backslash A=\\bigcup_{q\\in I_B}L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q,F))\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}arbitrary\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\nB\\backslash A=\\bigcup_{q\\in I_B}L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q,F))\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>右商只需更换终态；左商是有限多个改变初态的 DFA 语言的并。B 无须正则或可判定。特别保留原书的限制：任意 B 时这是存在性封闭，不能据此宣称能从 B 的任意描述有效算出 F_B。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-language-quotients","status":"resolved","id":"277b77eecf2ab276","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location